{"lyrics":"[00:00.08] (Ayy, Turn The Music Up For Me, Chris)\n[00:01.72] Turn the music up, ayy\n[00:05.54] She think I'm a crack baby, uh, yeah, ayy\n[00:09.14] She do coke like no 80's, yeah\n[00:10.50] Ya' dig? Ya' dig?\n[00:13.64] Smoking 'til my eyes bleed, don’t need no Visine (Visine)\n[00:17.12] I’m gon’ make my Sprite bleed, I got some red lean (Red lean)\n[00:20.54] Mixing the pills up, why? Because I’m lonely (Lonely)\n[00:23.98] Marry my drugs, why? Them my one and only (Only)\n[00:27.46] I'm lookin' for solitude (Solitude), searching for more peace\n[00:30.74] But everybody wanna nag (Nag), just like the police\n[00:34.38] I hope that you all die (Die)\n[00:36.40] No offense but (But), I've been tryna get high by myself (High)\n[00:41.10] They wonder why I'm like that\n[00:44.54] They text my phone, I won't text back\n[00:47.96] Leave me 'lone, 'lone ('Lone)\n[00:50.24] I don't need your attention, ho' (Ho'), ho', you can keep that\n[00:54.82] They say that I'm done for, they say I'm a goner (Goner)\n[00:58.26] They say I'm a junkie, I don't see the problem (Problem)\n[01:01.68] That must mean your boyfriend ain't nothin' (Nothin')\n[01:05.50] How a nigga on lean gettin' more money, ya dig? (Money)\n[01:10.26] Wake up, uh, light up like a cig' (Cig, oh-oh)\n[01:13.24] Drugs I take for grown men, no little kids (Kids, oh-oh)\n[01:16.68] Yeah, Molly on me, Cosby, lil' Bill (Bill)\n[01:19.60] And couple small pills ain't a big deal (Big deal)\n[01:22.22] Smoking 'til my eyes bleed, don’t need no Visine (Visine)\n[01:25.76] I’m gon’ make my Sprite bleed, I got some red lean (Red lean)\n[01:29.10] Mixing the pills up, why? Because I’m lonely (Lonely)\n[01:32.54] Marry my drugs, why? Them my one and only (Only)\n[01:36.14] I'm lookin' for solitude (Solitude), searching for more peace\n[01:39.32] But everybody wanna nag (Nag), just like the police\n[01:42.50] I hope that you all die (Die)\n[01:44.96] No offense but (But), I've been tryna get high by myself (High)\n[01:49.76] Up in Cali, walking through the waves ho', ayy (Wave)\n[01:53.12] Then we took the molly at the rave ho', uh (Rave)\n[01:56.12] Let the Percocets control you, you a slave ho', uh (Slave)\n[01:59.80] I’m the one that gave ‘em to you, I’m an a-hole, ya' dig? (A-hole)\n[02:03.42] Let her float, off the coke, first class shit, no coach (Phew)\n[02:06.42] If she die today, it's not my fault, I'm not her overdose (Ya' dig?)\n[02:10.08] Her eyes rollin' in the back of her head, she caught the holy ghost (Ya' dig?)\n[02:13.66] She was doing lines in the back of a Nova (Skrrt-skrrt)\n[02:17.32] I wonder what time it is, it’s over (Over)\n[02:20.54] Call me anything you want, but \"Sober\" (Sober)\n[02:24.00] Double cup my coffee cup, like Folgers (Folgers)\n[02:27.60] Got my plug pullin' up with that, oh yeah, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:30.94] Smoking 'til my eyes bleed, don’t need no Visine (Visine)\n[02:34.32] I’m gon’ make my Sprite bleed, I got some red lean (Red lean)\n[02:37.94] Mixing the pills up, why? Because I’m lonely (Lonely)\n[02:41.12] Marry my drugs, why? Them my one and only (Only)\n[02:44.60] I'm lookin' for solitude (Solitude), searching for more peace\n[02:47.90] But everybody wanna nag (Nag), just like the police\n[02:51.52] I hope that you all die (Die)\n[02:53.54] No offense but (But), I've been tryna get high by myself (High)\n[03:03.06] Oh-oh-oh-oh\n[03:10.36] Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh","words":[[0.08,0.14,"(Ayy,"],[0.18,0.3,"Turn"],[0.34,0.4,"The"],[0.46,0.74,"Music"],[0.82,0.84,"Up"],[0.94,1.06,"For"],[1.1,1.16,"Me,"],[1.24,1.42,"Chris)"],[1.72,2.04,"Turn"],[2.08,2.16,"the"],[2.34,2.94,"music"],[3.04,3.3,"up,"],[4.02,4.68,"ayy"],[5.54,5.62,"She"],[5.74,5.98,"think"],[6.06,6.16,"I'm"],[6.24,6.24,"a"],[6.38,6.68,"crack"],[6.82,7.06,"baby,"],[7.1,7.62,"uh,"],[7.9,8.98,"yeah,"],[9.04,9.1,"ayy"],[9.14,9.24,"She"],[9.28,9.3,"do"],[9.36,9.54,"coke"],[9.58,9.76,"like"],[9.8,9.88,"no"],[10.0,10.2,"80's,"],[10.28,10.46,"yeah"],[10.5,11.96,"Ya'"],[12.0,12.